    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47810" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάλος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό</span>,
		prop. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαλλός</span>
			, but only nom. and acc. in metaph. sense of <i>scion,
			child</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φίλον θ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				22.87
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευσσόντων τοιόνδε θ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				6.157
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλυκερόν, νέον θ.</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Cer.</u>
				66
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				187
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σεμνὸν θ. Ἀλκαϊδᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					6.68
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.45
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>El.</u>
				15
			</span></i>, etc.—For the pl., 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάλεα, τά</span>
			.</div>
